         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               SubframeQualityReview: Select one sky KPI for scoring, defaulting to Sky quality. Exclude masters from Score and R1–R4 while retaining comparison measurements. Shorten sky labels and align the compact selector with the weight controls.
            </p>
